1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,249
In Cap-Haitien's markets, a vendor's bank is a school notebook.

2
00:00:04,299 --> 00:00:08,323
Sales on one page, what the neighbours took on credit on another.

3
00:00:08,373 --> 00:00:12,021
Credit gets forgotten. And when a lender asks, show me your

4
00:00:12,071 --> 00:00:14,403
sales, there is nothing clean to show.

5
00:00:14,453 --> 00:00:16,910
About two billion people work like this.

6
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:22,239
Kaye, which means notebook in Haitian Creole, reads that notebook

7
00:00:22,289 --> 00:00:26,298
for her. It is built on Firebase AI Logic hybrid inference:

8
00:00:26,348 --> 00:00:30,563
Gemini Nano on the device first, Gemini in the cloud only when

9
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:33,247
it should, and only with what it needs.

10
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,422
No sign-up wall at a market stall.

11
00:00:36,472 --> 00:00:40,724
Tap try it now, and Firebase Authentication gives you a private

12
00:00:40,774 --> 00:00:44,752
notebook in seconds, with six weeks of sample sales, stored

13
00:00:44,802 --> 00:00:45,640
in Firestore.

14
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,073
Here is a handwritten sales page.

15
00:00:49,123 --> 00:00:53,532
One tap, and Gemini Nano reads the photo right here in Chrome,

16
00:00:53,582 --> 00:00:56,265
on this laptop, with no graphics card.

17
00:00:56,315 --> 00:00:58,135
Then Kaye checks the math.

18
00:00:58,185 --> 00:01:01,947
Every line, quantity times price, and the page total.

19
00:01:01,997 --> 00:01:05,111
Rice, beans, oil, sugar. Twenty one hundred.

20
00:01:05,161 --> 00:01:08,995
It all adds up. And the badge says it: on this device.

21
00:01:09,045 --> 00:01:11,440
The photo never left the computer.

22
00:01:12,583 --> 00:01:16,622
This page has a mistake. The total says thirty eight sixty,

23
00:01:16,672 --> 00:01:19,602
but the lines add up to thirty seven sixty.

24
00:01:19,652 --> 00:01:23,205
Kaye does not guess. It shows exactly what is wrong.

25
00:01:23,255 --> 00:01:27,433
A photo cannot have names removed, so before anything goes to

26
00:01:27,483 --> 00:01:30,343
the cloud, it asks. Her photo, her choice.

27
00:01:31,683 --> 00:01:36,031
Vendors can also just write it, the way they talk, in Kreyòl.

28
00:01:36,081 --> 00:01:40,500
Gemini Nano is not validated for Kreyòl yet, so this note goes

29
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:44,898
to the cloud. But first Kaye replaces the customers' names on

30
00:01:44,948 --> 00:01:48,141
the device. Gemini only sees C one and C two.

31
00:01:48,191 --> 00:01:51,313
The names come back when the answer returns.

32
00:01:52,217 --> 00:01:54,958
Who owes me keeps a running list of credit.

33
00:01:55,008 --> 00:01:58,788
One tap writes a polite reminder, and the AI never sees the

34
00:01:58,838 --> 00:01:59,827
customer's name.

35
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:04,532
And at the end of the month, a clean record for the lender.

36
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:08,493
Sales by week, best sellers, and a short summary written from

37
00:02:08,543 --> 00:02:10,572
totals only. Kaye keeps records.

38
00:02:10,622 --> 00:02:12,650
It never gives financial advice.

39
00:02:13,550 --> 00:02:17,912
The same engine runs on Android, with Gemini Nano through Firebase

40
00:02:17,962 --> 00:02:22,257
AI Logic. Here on a phone without a local model, Kaye asks before

41
00:02:22,307 --> 00:02:26,000
using the cloud, reads the page, and verifies the total.

42
00:02:26,050 --> 00:02:29,944
With no signal, Firestore keeps every line on the phone and

43
00:02:29,994 --> 00:02:32,150
syncs when the signal comes back.

44
00:02:33,083 --> 00:02:37,855
Six Firebase products carry the whole app: AI Logic, Firestore,

45
00:02:37,905 --> 00:02:42,141
Authentication, Remote Config, Analytics, and App Check.

46
00:02:42,191 --> 00:02:44,284
No backend of our own. Kaye.

47
00:02:44,334 --> 00:02:46,733
Your notebook, now it can count.
